  "result": "I fixed an inverted plan check in the search service. The search tests (15) now pass.\n\nThe bug was in `search()` in `src/server/services/search-service.ts`, where the colon check read `input.q.includes(\":\") && advanced`. That blocked colon queries on plans that include field-scoped search and let them through on plans that don't, which explains both tickets. Keyword searches have no colon, so they never reached the check and worked for everyone. I changed the condition to `!advanced`.",
